is selected.

Reviewed-by: Mike Rapoport (Microsoft) <rppt@kernel.org>
Acked-by: Catalin Marinas <catalin.marinas@arm.com>
Reviewed-by: Lorenzo Stoakes <lorenzo.stoakes@oracle.com>
